        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2089_7833.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> willig dienst,
<lb n="2"/>zuvor, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuersichtigen</unclear>, ersamen und weisen,
<lb n="3"/>besonders lieben gueten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freundte</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarn</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/>Demnach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bej</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rueff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschollen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">f</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bej</unclear> wenig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verloffner</unclear>
<lb n="6"/>zeit, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sorten</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darunder</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>auch sonderlich die <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Churer</unclear></orgName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sechßbäzner</unclear>, ange-
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schlagen</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verbotten</unclear> haben, ist <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darauf</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>in unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">statt</unclear>, so wol am <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lin</unclear>-
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">watbanckh</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> auch in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">andern</unclear> gemeinen
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bezahlungen</unclear>, der gemelten <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Churer</unclear></orgName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dickh</unclear>-
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pfenningen</unclear> halber, ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solche</unclear> ver-
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wirrung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entstanden</unclear>, daß sich ihrer
<lb n="14"/>vil mit derselben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sorten</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürwand</unclear>,
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">f</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>.
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abrüeffung</unclear>, nit wollen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bezalen</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>lassen.
<lb n="18"/>Damit dann wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verbesserung</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>solcher <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verwirrung</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">desto</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">baß</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear> zuverhalten, so gelangt an
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">f</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>. unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbar</unclear>-
<lb n="22"/>liches <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gesinnen</unclear>, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear> unß
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> bericht, ob und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> für
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sorten</unclear>, und auß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> ursachen, sie abge-
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ruefft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verbotten</unclear> haben, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bej</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeigern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> deßhalb ab-
<lb n="27"/>gefertigten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">läuffersbotten</unclear>,
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnbeschwert</unclear> zukommen lassen.
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Daß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begeren</unclear> wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auf</unclear> begebenheit
<lb n="30"/>mit willen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuerwidern</unclear>. Datum
<lb n="31"/>den <origDate when="1618-10-24" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">24</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">octobris</unclear> anno 1618</origDate>.
<lb n="32"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">B</unclear>. und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rhat</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="33"/>An die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">statt</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-511" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Lindaw</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="35"/>Mutatis mutandis
<lb n="36"/>an die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">statt</unclear>
<lb n="37"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-56" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Costanz</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2089_7834.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="38"/><origDate when="1618-03-24" resp="#ner">24. Martij 1618</origDate> an <origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-24" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Lindaw</origPlace>
<lb n="39"/>j. <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-7" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Costantz</placeName> wgen <persName resp="#ner">Thomae B. bauws</persName>.
</p>
